## Modularity Requirements

### Adding a New Feature
1. Backend: model → controller → route → `server.js` registration
2. Frontend: `api/{name}Api.js` → `pages/{name}/` → `routes/index.jsx` → `Sidebar.jsx`
3. Both layers must have authorization checks
4. Add notification types to `notificationModel.js` enum before using

### Notification System
```js
// ALWAYS use NotificationService, never create Notification docs directly
await NotificationService.sendToUser(userId, title, body, {
  type: "notification_type",  // Must exist in notificationModel enum
  senderId: req.user._id,
  actionUrl: "/path",
  priority: "normal",
  data: { id: doc._id.toString() }  // All values must be strings (FCM requirement)
});
```

### IST Timezone (Backend)
```js
// ALWAYS use these utilities, never new Date() for business logic:
import { getCurrentISTTime, getTodayMidnightIST, getTodayRangeIST } from "../utils/timezone.js";
```

