## Reuse/Component Guidelines

### Reuse These Existing Patterns
- Status badges: `getWorkLogStatusBadge()`, `PRStatusBadge`, `POStatusBadge`, `AssetStatusBadge`
- Currency: `new Intl.NumberFormat('en-IN', { style: 'currency', currency: 'INR' }).format(amount)`
- Date: `formatWorkLogDate()`, `formatWorkLogDateTime()` from `utils/workLogHelpers`
- Loading: `<Spinner animation="border" variant="primary" />`
- Confirm dialogs: `<ConfirmModal>` from `components/common/`
- Toast: `toast.success()`, `toast.error()` from `react-toastify`

### Management Page Tab Pattern
```jsx
// Default tab based on role:
const [activeTab, setActiveTab] = useState(isEmployee ? 'my-items' : 'dashboard');
// Hide admin tabs from employees:
{!isEmployee && <Tab eventKey="dashboard">...</Tab>}
```

### Soft Delete Pattern
```js
// WorkItem and Asset use soft delete:
isDeleted: Boolean, deletedAt: Date, deletedBy: ObjectId
// Always query: { isDeleted: { $ne: true } }
// Use: Model.findActive(query) static method
```

### Audit Log Pattern (Procurement)
```js
// Immutable — only push, never update:
doc.auditLog.push({ previousStatus, newStatus, changedBy: req.user._id, timestamp: new Date() });
```

---

## Do NOT

- Do NOT add Redux, Zustand, or any state management library
- Do NOT use Tailwind CSS
- Do NOT use Material UI or Ant Design
- Do NOT create Notification documents directly (use NotificationService)
- Do NOT use `new Date()` for business logic in backend (use IST utilities)
- Do NOT put parameterized routes before static routes
- Do NOT hard-delete WorkItems or Assets (use soft delete)
- Do NOT modify superadmin role or delete superadmin users
- Do NOT use `console.log` in production code (use `logger.js`)
- Do NOT add `employee` to procurement PO/GR/Invoice/Payment read access
